[CODE-OPTIMIZATION-STATUS]
UID: OPTIMIZATION

E200Z4_SCHEDULER:
File: llvm/lib/Target/PowerPC/PPCScheduleE200Z4.td
Status: ✓ Optimized per manual (e200z4RM Ch. 4.3)

Changes Made:
- Multiply latency: Fixed OperandCycles from [6,1,1,1,1] to [5,1,1,1,1] (2 cycles per manual)
- Divide latency: Verified at 14 cycles worst case (matches manual)
- Load latency: Fixed from 3 to 2 cycles (OperandCycles updated, LoadLatency updated)
- Store latency: Fixed from 3 to 2 cycles
- FP general latency: Verified at 2 cycles (already correct)
- FP divide latency: Verified at 13 cycles (already correct)
- Pairing rules: Enhanced documentation, resource conflict modeling explained
- Manual references: Added to all latency comments (e200z4RM Ch. 4.3)

CompleteModel: 0 (pairing rules need runtime validation for edge cases)

